# enter-exec-print.trace -- canonical standard raw-REPL exchange.
# W = host -> device write, R = device -> host read.
# Enter raw (Ctrl-A), run print(123), leave to friendly REPL (Ctrl-B).
W 01
R 0D 0A "raw REPL; CTRL-B to exit" 0D 0A 3E
W "print(123)" 04
R 4F 4B "123" 0D 0A 04 04 3E
W 02
R 0D 0A "MicroPython v1.26.0 on 2026-10-16; Generic board" 0D 0A 3E 3E 3E 20
